Now realtime: regenerate report on message.updated too. Extract report writing into a helper function and call on message.updated as well.

Current code in writeEvent:
```ts
    await appendFile(join(rawDirectory, `${sessionId}.jsonl`), `${JSON.stringify(row)}\n`, "utf8");

    if (type === "session.idle") {
      const reportsDir = join(root, "docs", "ai-logs", "reports");
      ...
      const report = buildReport(...);
      await writeFile(reportPath, report, "utf8");
    }
```

Extract into a nested function `writeReport(sessionId, rawDirectory)` and call for session.idle and message.updated. Let me edit.

